        "subject": "LU-21223 tests: wait for quota sync in sanity-quota 84",
        "message": "LU-21223 tests: wait for quota sync in sanity-quota 84\n\nThe test sets a 100M group block hardlimit right after a quota\nreset and immediately runs dd expecting EDQUOT. The limit may not\nhave reached the OST quota slave yet, so the group lqe is still\nnot enforced and the write succeeds. This was seen on ZFS.\n\nWait for the new hardlimit to reach the OST before each dd.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=sanity-quota env=ONLY=84\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-sonnet-5-5\nSigned-off-by: Patrick Farrell <patrick@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: If7a0721e5c8cee54154a8e2a7702c51c952f7ca3\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master",
      "description": "Edit commit message"
    }
